    "updated_at": "2022-07-07T17:32:12Z",
    "body": "> Would it at least be possible to provide a unique session id per device that does _not_ survive a disconnect event? Anything at this point would be welcome.\r\n\r\nThis is already possible as `HIDDevice` instances are `===` comparable. Every call to `getDevices()` will return the same instances until disconnection. If you want to give a device a human-readable ID you can generate one and maintain a `Map`.",
